From: Sid <sid7513@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:38:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] jobstate: dispute games (bisection to one element,
 one-step proofs) and serve-or-slash, with fault-injection suite

- MODEL_REG carries the architecture; JOB_POST carries tokens per sequence
- DISPUTE_MOVE / ONE_STEP: trace bisection, row-block bisection, referee recomputation; silent or
  invalid movers lose; both-wrong penalizes both
- DATA_REQUEST / DATA_SERVE: stage inputs proven against the previous stage, verification waits
- tests: 14 fault scenarios + 60-trial property over all 26 op types

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
